<title>BERMUDA: CRICKET-NZ-SRI LANKA 2ND TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NZ-SRI LANKA 2ND TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, New Zealand 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final scoreboard</p>
<p>on the fourth day of the second test between New Zealand and Sri</p>
<p>Lanka on Monday.</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 222</p>
<p>Sri Lanka first innings 170</p>
<p>New Zealand second innings 273</p>
<p>Sri Lanka second innings (overnight 20 for two wickets)</p>
<p> S. Jayasuriya run out			    3</p>
<p> R. Mahanama lbw b Doull			 65</p>
<p> H. Tillekaratne b Vettori		     10</p>
<p> C. Vaas c Patel b Vettori			8</p>
<p> A. de Silva lbw b Doull			  5</p>
<p> A. Ranatunga c Doull b Vettori		33</p>
<p> R. Kaluwitharana lbw b Doull		  13</p>
<p> K. Dharmasena not out			   38</p>
<p> N. Zoysa c Parore b Vettori		   13</p>
<p> S. de Silva c Young b Davis		    0</p>
<p> M. Muralitharan c Cairns b Vettori	   7</p>
<p> Extras (b-4, lb-5, w-1)			 10</p>
<p> Total						205</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-5 2-16 3-40 4-50 5-129 6-147 7-152 8-185</p>
<p>9-186</p>
<p>Bowling: Doull 15-4-34-3, Davis 17-4-35-1 (w-1), Vettori</p>
<p>29.2-8-84-5, Patel 12-5-34-0, Astle 3-1-9-0.</p>
<p>Result: New Zealand won by 120 runs, and clinched the</p>
<p>two-match series 2-0.</p>
<p>Man-of-the-match: D.Vettori.</p>
</text>
